{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2024-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1711238400, "end_date": 1711929599, "month_true_total": 634, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:59:47 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "161891314", "author": {"steamid": "76561199020488194", "personaname": "BT-7374", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/catltm/", "num_games_owned": 245, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 25126, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14963, "last_played": 1778078414, "avatar": "6889e542266ff1eca9c32d7f405a723a0e19f756"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h1] 观前提醒 [/h1]仅代表个人看法\n在此游戏中，你将扮演潜入霍克斯Ⅳ星的矿工矮人，对当地原住民进行屠杀，提取稀有资源，破坏敌对公司设施，完成公司指标，然后溜之大吉。\n[h3] 总体评价 [/h3][spoiler] 耐玩，好玩，但是重复感高，驱动力不强。 [/spoiler]\n优点：\n[list]\n    [*]任务地图随机生成，不同大地区有不同的地图特色\n    [*]武器种类多样，每个职业各有三把具有职业特色的主武器和副武器\n    [*]画面风格独具一格\n    [*]有趣的故事背景，矮人（玩家）间的互动\n[/list]\n缺点：\n[list]\n    [*]有友伤，可能导致高血压。[spoiler] 个人认为是游戏特色，难度越高友伤系数越高，越考验玩家技术 [/spoiler]\n    [*][b] 个  别  怪  物 [/b]及其恶心（机制）[spoiler] 番茄酱射手，蝎子莱莱和岩痘系怪物 [/spoiler]\n    [*]巨肝，晋升要肝，通行证要肝，武器模组要肝。\n[/list]\n就这么多，这款游戏的乐趣就是多人合作，享受人与人之间的真诚，不分年龄，不分国籍，在任务结束后记得称赞你的队友！\nRock And Stone！", "timestamp_created": 1711900845, "timestamp_updated": 1711900998, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161884264", "author": {"steamid": "76561198846043679", "personaname": "雯菁睡觉打呼鲁", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198846043679/", "num_games_owned": 61, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 375, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 312, "last_played": 1711910966, "avatar": "cbf2d78f0ecfc61